- * this runs in the RX path and may be called with ppe_lock held.
+ * by a VLAN-filtering bridge that has no PVID): no tag is added or removed.
+ * For a real VLAN, br_vlan_get_info_rcu() tells whether the port is a member
+ * and whether it emits the VID untagged; br_vlan_get_pvid_rcu() tells whether
+ * this is the port PVID. Both are RCU variants because this runs in the RX
